STEP 1 - CREATE NEW FILE
==================================================
PATH:
/root/my-loan-project/redis_memory.py

CODE:
import redis
import json

redis_client = redis.Redis(
    host='localhost',
    port=6379,
    decode_responses=True
)

PURPOSE:
Create Redis connection.

==================================================
STEP 2 - ADD HISTORY READER
==================================================
FILE:
redis_memory.py

ADD:

def get_history(user):

    data = redis_client.get(user)

    if not data:
        return []

    return json.loads(data)

PURPOSE:
Read old conversations.

==================================================
STEP 3 - ADD HISTORY WRITER
==================================================
FILE:
redis_memory.py

ADD:

def save_message(user, question, answer):

    history = get_history(user)

    history.append(
        {
            'question': question,
            'answer': answer
        }
    )

    redis_client.set(
        user,
        json.dumps(history)
    )

PURPOSE:
Save new conversation.

